  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "2024阿却賞tio̍h獎作品——百字寫台文（作者：N̂g Tsu-kî 黃資淇）"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p><span style=\"font-size: large; text-align: justify;\">（高中職組 優等）</span></p><h1 style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: x-large;\">踮海邊</span></h1><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">高雄市立新興高中</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: large; text-align: left;\"><b>作者：</b></span><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><b>N̂g Tsu-kî 黃資淇</b></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\">踮海岸邊，海湧一tsūn一tsūn拍tī海坪仔，思念ná像海水倒激，hōo我ê心內tín動未定。直目看ǹg he無尾ê海面，ǹg望看著你tī千里外ê形影。海風tshiûnn面，吹hōo目屎tsha̍p-tsha̍p滴。Uì透早食海風到beh暗仔，tsit phiàn海ê日頭tih-beh落山，但是你hia ê天哪tsiah拄仔拆ha̍h niā-niā？</span></div><div><span style=\"font-size: large;\"><br /></span></div></div><a name='more'></a><p></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiy-Hdl_q_p70kVk8TdO41bayxUM2chF7ARpn-3R3s63opRQjBltjTTPa5x6GMZ_7gywcrNJKf31GAvbfn5Yo2zQuaBhYt_PEu8hW0XooU5zWFl4YtaVPUaHXizgsHUSqn4V3BUB8lv7YZawsX5qVLWrbwZz73-ceTFOal19MLKjs7qc_khb5MhYVBAYANJ/s3036/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1368%E6%9C%9F_017_a.jpg\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"3036\" data-original-width=\"2150\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/b/R29vZ2xl/AVvXsEiy-Hdl_q_p70kVk8TdO41bayxUM2chF7ARpn-3R3s63opRQjBltjTTPa5x6GMZ_7gywcrNJKf31GAvbfn5Yo2zQuaBhYt_PEu8hW0XooU5zWFl4YtaVPUaHXizgsHUSqn4V3BUB8lv7YZawsX5qVLWrbwZz73-ceTFOal19MLKjs7qc_khb5MhYVBAYANJ/w454-h640/%E5%8F%B0%E6%96%87%E9%80%9A%E8%A8%8ABONG%E5%A0%B1368%E6%9C%9F_017_a.jpg\" width=\"454\" /></a></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div><br /><div class=\"separator\" styl